"n":"0289c","t":"因中有以要從因出不從非因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0290a01","n":"0290a","t":"當有當破既在後那得跨從後"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0290b01","n":"0290b","t":"入常故次破常問舊亦云實滅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0290c01","n":"0290c","t":"正破於生不正破無但為對僧"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0291a01","n":"0291a","t":"生者謂因中前有果也無生者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0291b01","n":"0291b","t":"初名之為初此是未有生相不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0291c01","n":"0291c","t":"生法體次就法體明於已未生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0292a01","n":"0292a","t":"曰初中後非次第生十地三十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0292b01","n":"0292b","t":"若生備三便有二過一相害二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0292c01","n":"0292c","t":"相若有生相生不孤立必生瓶"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0293a01","n":"0293a","t":"外云有能則有所有所則有能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0293b01","n":"0293b","t":"無別體用泥為瓶泥因既壞瓶"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0293c01","n":"0293c","t":"相生互之一字含於二句有不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0294a01","n":"0294a","t":"緣今偏執緣不達其因故壞母"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0294b01","n":"0294b","t":"常今品別破五種常法若總若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0294c01","n":"0294c","t":"佛果故名五常此品論者二同"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0295a01","n":"0295a","t":"為有所以故說常為無所以漫"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0295b01","n":"0295b","t":"百論師謂此文是於一難今明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0295c01","n":"0295c","t":"者世間外道小乘大乘共知虛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0296a01","n":"0296a","t":"此瓶中之空是有分空家一分"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0296b01","n":"0296b","t":"法塵既是法塵便是有法又舊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0296c01","n":"0296c","t":"明空得容空而墮二空今免於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0297a01","n":"0297a","t":"亦麁顯故次空破之釋時有二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0297b01","n":"0297b","t":"未來也過去時既常則過去定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0297c01","n":"0297c","t":"就未來中無過去是果中無因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0298a01","n":"0298a","t":"字前明過去不作未來瓶故非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0298b01","n":"0298b","t":"明三世皆現今捉行相明過去"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0298c01","n":"0298c","t":"方我六法藏中有四法藏無則"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0299a01","n":"0299a","t":"天下說方相故一天下方定無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0299b01","n":"0299b","t":"常無我不淨令人得道以諸論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0299c01","n":"0299c","t":"今既與虛空異虛空無十方則"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0300a01","n":"0300a","t":"苦事此似內義涅槃體有空與"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0300b01","n":"0300b","t":"破外無餘初又二前一明涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0300c01","n":"0300c","t":"會真生解及數人因境發智境"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0301a01","n":"0301a","t":"縛異正觀故涅槃非是解脫用"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0301b01","n":"0301b","t":"則心行處滅譬如燈滅明語言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0301c01","n":"0301c","t":"百論疏卷下之餘釋吉藏撰破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0302a01","n":"0302a","t":"不緣觀盡於緣是則非觀故非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0302b01","n":"0302b","t":"彼眾師眾師皆心有所得言有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0302c01","n":"0302c","t":"懺為能破罪是可破豈非外道"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0303a01","n":"0303a","t":"答空有四句皆破但對前八品"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0303b01","n":"0303b","t":"者須精密取之能離菩薩微細"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0303c01","n":"0303c","t":"破法人及滅佛法人是故答云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0304a01","n":"0304a","t":"有俱是所破則無能破既無能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0304b01","n":"0304b","t":"問能破又能破若有還是汝有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0304c01","n":"0304c","t":"破是空之異名故也是破若有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0305a01","n":"0305a","t":"一而言執此彼耶答一異語局"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0305b01","n":"0305b","t":"人謂有能破今第二破外人謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0305c01","n":"0305c","t":"主論主上云汝是破人汝既詺"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0306a01","n":"0306a","t":"有申正而未曾有邪可破何曾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0306b01","n":"0306b","t":"立故有破立既不成無立可待"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0306c01","n":"0306c","t":"道義如邪見人撥無諸法是人"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0307a01","n":"0307a","t":"我者汝是滅法人文正爾也又"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0307b01","n":"0307b","t":"未知何者是一物而作待問故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0307c01","n":"0307c","t":"有絕待答終有妙術問者竟不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0308a01","n":"0308a","t":"次釋十方三世佛菩薩出世破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0308b01","n":"0308b","t":"還奪取故彼經有於第四猶是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0308c01","n":"0308c","t":"故有此章也外問意云若言內"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0309a01","n":"0309a","t":"凡聖二緣又云㮈譬一色瓜棗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0309b01","n":"0309b","t":"就二於論之於凡是實故名諦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1827_p0309c01","n":"0309c","t":"然者他云斷除煩惱留眾生置"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T42n1827-百論疏","source":"CBETA T42n1827 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":234,"unit":"T42 頁欄"}